  "text": "NIDDK Clinical Guidance on Indigestion & Dyspepsia Management | Publisher: National Instit\nRed Flags for Gastrointestinal Conditions\nSeek Emergency Medical Care Immediately If You Experience: - Severe,\nsharp, or sudden abdominal pain. - Vomiting blood or material that looks\nlike coffee grounds. - Black, tarry, or bloody stools. - Difficulty\nswallowing (dysphagia) or painful swallowing. - Unintentional significant\nweight loss. - Persistent vomiting preventing fluid intake.\nPage 2 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
